919 is a job search app that includes a large casting database in modeling, entertainment, hospitality, service, and music.

With this app you can find the job of your dreams:
- choose a suitable role for yourself: applicant, company, freelancer, recruiter;
- elect auditions for your interests;
- respond to vacancies which you are interested in;
- create a colorful portfolio;
- take an interview with the employer into the chat;
- create castings with requirements for the applicant: type of appearance, hair color, knowledge of languages, video presentation, and much more;
- let recruiters conduct auditions on behalf of your company.

Once you fill in all the necessary information about your interests, you will instantly see a selection of unique castings.
You will be able to apply for suitable castings. Each vacancy contains a short description, location, payment, and requirements for the applicant.
We advise you to fill in your profile in detail in order to look more attractive to the employer comparing to other applicants. After approving the candidacy, the employer will be able to start a chat with you and conduct an interview.

With the «919» app you will be always aware of current high-paying vacancies in the UAE and other countries of the world.

